ween Origami patches","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","url":"\/documentation\/swami","title":"Swami","type":"topic","role":"collection"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/toolbar(id:content:)":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"toolbar","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Content","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"id","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"content","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": () -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Content","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP","text":"View","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/toolbar(id:content:)","title":"toolbar(id:content:)","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/toolbar(id:content:)"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView":{"title":"Interaction_DragView","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Drags a layer in any direction with momentum and rubber-band bounds. The draggable"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"card responds to touch input via Origami’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"origami.Drag"},{"type":"text","text":" patch, which wires its"},{"t